   "overlap_possible_at_s_3.82": true,
   "overlap_possible_at_s_hat": true,
   "interpretation": "X0(BL) + X0(BR) >= s is NECESSARY for the two corner 2-crowds to interfere, not sufficient (the envelopes are axis-aligned bounding constraints, not the squares).  A pair of jammed 2-crowds at opposite ends of the bottom wall therefore is NOT excluded by reach arithmetic alone."
  }
